      },
      "text": "Since the 2016 publication, Microsoft has come across an evolution of PLATINUM’s file-transfer tool, one that uses the Intel® Active Management Technology (AMT) Serial-over-LAN (SOL) channel for communication.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_8",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Microsoft_PLATINUM-evolve-find-ways-to-maintain-invisibility(06-07-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s1"
      },
      "text": "AMT Serial-over-LAN (SOL) communication channel Active Management Technology (AMT) enables remote management of devices and is provided as a feature of Intel® vPro™ processors and chipsets.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_10",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Microsoft_PLATINUM-evolve-find-ways-to-maintain-invisibility(06-07-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s3"
      },
      "text": "AMT has a Serial-over-LAN (SOL) feature that exposes a virtual serial device with a chipset-provided channel over",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
